# The .gitignore of every data branch, which holds a byte-identical copy of
# this file (tools/data-branch.gitignore on main). A data branch holds the DID
# document and the revocation records, and nothing else: every other path is
# ignored, so that a tool cannot commit a stray file by mistake. The build
# refuses a data branch whose .gitignore differs from this file.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.well-known/
/.well-known/*
!/.well-known/did.json
!/revocations/
/revocations/**
!/revocations/*/
!/revocations/*.json
!/revocations/*/*.ots
!/revocations/*/*.tsr
